## 5. Deploy + custom domain

`wrangler deploy` (your `deploy` script = `bun run build && wrangler deploy`). With the config above, deploy will:

1. Upload the Worker bundle + static assets as a single unit.
2. Apply the DO class lifecycle (`exports` or `migrations`). **Lifecycle changes only apply via `wrangler deploy`** — `wrangler versions upload` will fail-fast if `exports` entries are present.
3. Provision the **Custom Domain**: with `routes: [{ pattern: "wobble-rush.mengmota.com", custom_domain: true }]`, Cloudflare **auto-creates the DNS record and issues the Advanced Certificate** — you do not manually touch DNS.

Custom Domain requirements (verified, page dated 2026-06-23):
- An **active Cloudflare zone** for `mengmota.com` in the same account.
- **No existing CNAME** on the hostname `wobble-rush` (Cloudflare will refuse). Wildcard DNS is **not** supported for Custom Domains.
- Custom Domains point **all paths** of the hostname to the Worker (path/query ignored in matching), which is exactly what you want for a game served from one host.

**Required token scopes** (the "Edit Cloudflare Workers" API token template covers most; add zone DNS for auto-provisioning):
- Account scope: **Workers Scripts: Edit**, **Durable Objects: Edit** (implicitly under Workers), Account Settings: Read.
- Zone scope (`mengmota.com`): **Workers Routes: Edit**, **DNS: Edit** (so the custom_domain flow can create the record), **SSL and Certificates: Edit** (for the Advanced Certificate it provisions), Zone: Read.
- For CI (your `wrangler-action@v3`), store as `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` secret; the Hono guide recommends the "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template as a baseline.

Verify post-deploy: `curl -i https://wobble-rush.mengmota.com` → `HTTP/2 200`; open a Playwright context to confirm the SPA loads; connect two WS clients to confirm relay (your C7 + C4 criteria).

Docs:
- Custom Domains: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/routing/custom-domains/
- Routes and domains overview: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/routing/
- Wrangler deploy / deployment management: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/deploy/

